{{Documentation}}
This template is used to display the enemies appearing in a stage, for use at the top of a page below other templates, if any.

==How to Use==
*Using the information from the stage's battleground data and write out the enemies in order.
**Click on the [https://battlecats-db.com/ DB] link on the bottom of the page if you do not have this readily available.
*Do not include the trait or magnification of each enemy in the template.
*Do not include [[Ms. Sign]].
*Visit [[Module:Enemies.csv|here]] for a list of usable enemies if you get [[:Category:Pages with script errors|script errors]] or if you are unsure about an enemy name.

==Example Usage==
===Stage Info===
{{Magnification|Doge|0
|Snache|0
|Pigge|0
|Midnite D.|0}}

===Written like this===
<pre>
{{EnemiesAppearing|Doge|Snache|Pigge|Midnite D.}}
</pre>

===Result===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Doge|Snache|Pigge|Midnite D.}}

